    "title": "The Quantum Issue: Letter From The Editor",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/print/the-quantum-issue-letter-from-the-editor",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Quantum-Issue-Article-Header-2400x1256-1.png\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/print/the-quantum-issue-letter-from-the-editor\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Quantum Issue: Letter From The Editor</a></p>\n<p>The Quantum Issue takes a look at the risk of quantum computing to Bitcoin, how exposed the network is, and the current state of solutions to protect it.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/print/the-quantum-issue-letter-from-the-editor\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Quantum Issue: Letter From The Editor</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/shinobi\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shinobi</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Quantum-Issue-Article-Header-2400x1256-1.png\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/print/the-quantum-issue-letter-from-the-editor\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Quantum Issue: Letter From The Editor</a></p>\n<p>The Quantum Issue takes a look at the risk of quantum computing to Bitcoin, how exposed the network is, and the current state of solutions to protect it.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/print/the-quantum-issue-letter-from-the-editor\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Quantum Issue: Letter From The Editor</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/shinobi\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shinobi</a>.</p>",
